{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2022-06-30 09:30:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN TEMPLETON LAUNCHES RESPONSIBLY SOURCED GOLD ETF (FGLD)', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FRANKLIN TEMPLETON TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF FRANKLIN RESPONSIBLY SOURCED GOLD ETF (FGLD). FGLD SEEKS TO REFLECT THE PERFORMANCE OF THE PRICE OF GOLD BULLION, LESS THE EXPENSE OF FUND OPERATIONS, AND IS PRICED AT 15 BASIS POINTS. THE SHARES WILL TRADE ON NYSE ARCA. THE FUND DEFINES “RESPONSIBLY SOURCED GOLD” AS LONDON GOOD DELIVERY GOLD BULLION BARS THAT WERE REFINED ON OR AFTER JANUARY 1, 2012, WHICH HAVE BEEN REFINED IN ACCORDANCE WITH LONDON BULLION MARKET ASSO'}